-- ============================================================
-- PantryBuddy - Household Inventory Reminder System
-- Iteration 2 - insert_static_data.sql
--
-- This file runs in TiDB Cloud together with schema.sql, so it must
-- carry every row the application needs. It is organised in seven
-- sections:
--
--   Section 1  Iteration 1 static data, copied unchanged
--              (3 storage types, 16 product categories, 200 products,
--               612 shelf_life_rules)
--   Section 2  product_categories: comment only, no new categories
--   Section 3  product_reference (7881 rows, explicit reference_id)
--   Section 4  product_keyword_mapping (24460 rows)
--   Section 5  price_item_reference (284 rows)
--   Section 6  price_observations (2000-row Iteration 2 sample)
--   Section 7  data volume notes
--
-- Large tables are inserted in batches of complete INSERT statements so
-- that no single statement becomes unreasonably large for TiDB Cloud.
--
-- The target database must already be selected (for example
-- Real_ProjectV2.0_TM06) before this script runs, because Section 1 is
-- the Iteration 1 file and contains no USE statement.
-- ============================================================

